# uv.lock is committed for the reproducible contributor environment.
# Library users still resolve within the dependency ranges in pyproject.toml.

# Host-specific launchers and one dataset's example label list. These are kept
# on the maintainer's machine but deliberately not published: they encode one
# cluster's paths, tmux and GPU layout, and the label list was chosen while
# looking at scores, so it must not be reused as an evaluation input. The
# launchers that the evaluation study actually invokes DO ship -- see
# scripts/README.md.
